# Public site URL. Used for canonical links, hreflang and the sitemap.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://edu-development.org

# --- Contact form delivery -------------------------------------------------
# Pick ONE backend. With neither set, the form still works end to end and the
# message is logged with a warning instead of being delivered.

# Option A: Firestore + the Trigger Email extension.
# Requires `npm install firebase-admin`.
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
# FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=
# FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n"
# Where notifications go. Point at the Program Manager until EFDA has a role
# inbox on its own domain.
# CONTACT_NOTIFY_TO=

# Option B: Formspree.
# FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx

# --- Spam ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Turnstile. These two are ONE SWITCH - set both or neither.
#
# The public key makes the browser render the widget and produce a token; the
# secret lets the server check it. Setting only one leaves spam protection OFF
# and logs an error on every submission, rather than rejecting enquiries the
# browser had no way to get a token for.
#
# Cloudflare's published always-passes test pair, for local checks:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
#   TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
# NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
